       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BENCH-ARITH.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNTER    PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-RESULT     PIC 9(18) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-A           PIC 9(9) VALUE 12345.
       01 WS-B           PIC 9(9) VALUE 67890.
       01 WS-ITERATIONS  PIC 9(9) VALUE 1000000.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM WS-ITERATIONS TIMES
               COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-A * WS-B + WS-A - WS-B
               ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "ARITHMETIC BENCHMARK"
           DISPLAY "ITERATIONS: " WS-COUNTER
           DISPLAY "FINAL RESULT: " WS-RESULT
           STOP RUN.
